flowchart TD
    %% ------------------ Dev / Repo ------------------
    Dev[Git Commit / Pull Request] --> CI[CI Pipeline: Jenkins]

    %% ------------------ CI Pipeline ------------------
    CI -->|Full Tree Snapshot + Signed Manifest| Release[Immutable Release Directory]
    Release --> Storage[FlashBlade Storage]

    %% ------------------ Storage Replication ------------------
    Storage -->|Async bucket replication| StorageCross[FlashBlade Cross-Region]

    %% ------------------ Region A Nodes ------------------
    subgraph RegionA["Region A Nodes (~2000)"]
        NodesA[Linux/VM/Baremetal Nodes] -->|Jitter + rsync| SwitchA[Atomic Symlink Switch]
        SwitchA --> ServiceA[Restart Service or SIGHUP if Config Changed]
    end

    %% ------------------ Region B Nodes ------------------
    subgraph RegionB["Region B Nodes (~2000)"]
        NodesB[Linux/VM/Baremetal Nodes] -->|Jitter + rsync| SwitchB[Atomic Symlink Switch]
        SwitchB --> ServiceB[Restart Service or SIGHUP if Config Changed]
    end

    %% ------------------ Connections ------------------
    Storage --> NodesA
    StorageCross --> NodesB
